<title>UK: Clydeport names Tom Allison chief executive.</title>
<headline>Clydeport names Tom Allison chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Port and property services company Clydeport Plc announced on Thursday the appointment of Tom Allison as its new chief executive.</p>
<p>Allison will take up his appointment on September 1.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
